{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13619","headline":"酬刘员外见寄 · 严维","name":"酬刘员外见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏耽佐郡时，近出白云司。\n药补清羸疾，窗吟绝妙词。\n柳塘春水慢，花坞夕阳迟。\n欲识怀君意，明朝访檝师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「酬刘员外见寄」条，撰者储仲君、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"储仲君"}